## Architecture Plan

### 1. Server (`ui/server.ts` + engine integration)

A Bun HTTP server, one per pool. Serves:
- Static SPA from `ui/dist/`
- JSON API:
  - `GET /api/state` → current snapshot (or `{snapshot}`)
  - `POST /api/start` → start the run (calls `runPool`)
  - `POST /api/resume` → body `{ticketId, note, action}` → call resume/approve/reject
- SSE `GET /api/stream` → full snapshot on every change

The server runs the engine in-process. It holds the current `PoolRun`. On every `onSnapshot`, it broadcasts to SSE clients and caches the latest snapshot.

Key design: the server process stays alive. It calls `runPool` once at start (or on `/api/start`). `runPool` drives to the first quiescent/done/stalled, calling `onSnapshot` throughout. The returned `PoolRun` has `resume`/`approve`/`reject` that return the next `PoolRun`. The server chains these.

