But there's a subtlety with SSE: snapshots are pushed on every change. During `runPool`'s drive, `onSnapshot` fires. So SSE needs to be wired to `onSnapshot`.

Let me design the server to be in `ui/` (it serves the UI and talks to the engine). It imports `runPool` from `../engine/engine.ts`. It's a Bun server using `Bun.serve`.

Let me structure:
